LIBRARY SR

; The real SR.DLL export is variadic with a long line number. Recovered source
; deliberately declares a fixed-arity int form, because VC6 only emits the
; canonical bodies that way; both are the same 32-bit cdecl call ABI. The
; aliases below make that declaration resolve against the real export instead
; of failing to link, and cover the C form used by the .c translation units.
EXPORTS
    ?srAssertFail@@YAXPBD0J0ZZ
    ?srAssertFail@@YAXPBD0H0@Z = ?srAssertFail@@YAXPBD0J0ZZ
    srAssertFail = ?srAssertFail@@YAXPBD0J0ZZ
